==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|koliko|lang=sh}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/kolǐko/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|ko|li|ko}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=kolìko|r|колико|колѝко}}

# (''interrogatively'') [[how much]], [[how many]]
#: ''koliko imaš godina?'' — how old are you?
#: ''koliko imaš jabuka?'' — how many apples do you have?
#: ''koliko je sati?'' — what time is it?
#: ''koliko puta?'' — how many times?
#: ''koliko dugo?'' — (for) how long?
# [[as much as]], [[as many as]], [[as]]
#: ''kupi onoliko igračaka koliko je djece'' — buy as many toys as there are children
#: ''ona je skoro inteligentna koliko i ja'' — she is almost as intelligent as I am
# ({{term|ma|mȁ|lang=sh}} + ~, ~ + {{term|god|lang=sh}}) [[no matter how much]]
#: ''koliko god mu daš, nikad mu nije dosta'' — no matter how much you give him, it's never enough for him

